    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποντοπορ-έω</span></b> , = foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῦς ποντοποροῦσα</span>”
				<i>sea-sailing,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				24.54
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				30.19
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				7.397
			</span></i>; <i>sail the open sea.</i> opp. a coasting voyage, <i><span class="en">
